</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>If Thou hadst bid Thy thunders roll,</l><l>And light’nings flash, to blast my soul,</l><l>I still had stubborn been;</l><l>But mercy has my heart subdued,</l><l>A bleeding Savior I have viewed,</l><l>And now I hate my sin.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Now, Lord, I would be Thine alone,</l><l>Come, take possession of Thine own,</l><l>For Thou hast set me free;</l><l>Released from Satan’s hard command,</l><l>See all my powers waiting stand,</l><l>To be employed by Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
